## 📋 Manual URL Replacement (If Needed)

If you want to replace URLs manually, the format is:
```
https://res.cloudinary.com/your-cloud-name/image/upload/paaru-studio/filename.ext
```

Example in HTML:
```html
<!-- Replace this -->
<img src="logo.png">

<!-- With this -->
<img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/your-cloud-name/image/upload/paaru-studio/logo.png">
```

